data: {"id": "9620ed9fd8aa4f2c-thinking-parallel_evidence-1167", "run_id": "9620ed9fd8aa4f2c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=506 lines=10\nInvestigation plan updated with 6 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 0 completed, 1 in progress, 5 pending\n[ ] [2] kubectl_get_yaml - 验证资源限制、探", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788805092580, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_466812c11b9f4e81b977a292", "tool_sequence": 1, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=506 lines=10\nInvestigation plan updated with 6 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 0 completed, 1 in progress, 5 pending\n[ ] [2] kubectl_get_yaml - 验证资源限制、探针配置和镜像\n[ ] [3] kubectl_previous_logs - 查看崩溃前最后日志\n[ ] [4] kubectl_events - 查看 BackOff、Killing 等事件\n[ ] [5] query_pod_topology - 确认控制器、Service、节点关系\n[ ] [6] 综合评估：OOMKilled vs CrashLoopBackOffRuntime 直接原因\n[~] [1] kubectl_describe pod - 确认 Last State、Exit Code、Reason、重启次数和事件\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/9620ed9fd8aa4f2c-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/9620ed9fd8aa4f2c-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/9620ed9fd8aa4f2c-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

