data: {"id": "9620ed9fd8aa4f2c-thinking-parallel_evidence-1720", "run_id": "9620ed9fd8aa4f2c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=506 lines=10\nInvestigation plan updated with 6 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 4 completed, 1 in progress, 1 pending\n[ ] [6] 综合评估：OOMKilled vs CrashLoop", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788805139702, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_f701d90f249042bcabaaae9b", "tool_sequence": 7, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=506 lines=10\nInvestigation plan updated with 6 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 4 completed, 1 in progress, 1 pending\n[ ] [6] 综合评估：OOMKilled vs CrashLoopBackOffRuntime 直接原因\n[~] [5] query_pod_topology - 确认控制器、Service、节点关系\n[✓] [1] kubectl_describe pod - 确认 Last State、Exit Code、Reason、重启次数和事件\n[✓] [2] kubectl_get_yaml - 验证资源限制、探针配置和镜像\n[✓] [3] kubectl_previous_logs - 查看崩溃前最后日志\n[✓] [4] kubectl_events - 查看 BackOff、Killing 等事件\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/9620ed9fd8aa4f2c-g1/tools/010-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/9620ed9fd8aa4f2c-g1/tools/010-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/9620ed9fd8aa4f2c-g1/tools/010-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

